    "body": "## Summary\n\n- handle `--help` before CLI route lookup\n- avoid accidental `KeyError`/`IndexError` for help and empty invocation\n- add regression coverage for CLI argument handling\n\n## Tests\n\n- `test_cli_help`: verified `--help` does not raise `KeyError` and exits successfully\n- `test_cli_no_args`: verified empty command does not raise `IndexError`\n- `test_cli_unknown_command`: verified unknown command raises sensible error\n- `test_cli_valid_command`: verified valid command successfully resolves route\n\nCloses #10287",
